### ============================================================
### 05 · 码表维护 /api/setting/:kind（两张表各一套实现）
### ------------------------------------------------------------
###   :kind = airlines  → airplane_company_name_code  航司码
###            { id, chinese_airplane_company_name,
###              airplane_company_iata_code, airplane_company_icao_code }
###   :kind = airports  → airport_name_code           机场码
###            { id, chinese_airport_name, english_airport_name,
###              airport_iata_code, airport_icao_code }
###
### ★ 请求体 / 响应的键 = **数据库原始列名**，没有驼峰别名。
###   没传的键不出现 → 天然是局部更新语义。
###
### 唯一约束：两张表的中文名 / IATA / ICAO 三列各自 UNIQUE，
### 撞了就是 409（Prisma P2002 → conflict）。
###
### 顺序：A 查询 → B 机场码 CRUD → C 航司码 CRUD
###      B / C 段自建自删（用 Z 打头的假码，不会撞真数据）
### ============================================================

@host = http://localhost:5183


### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### A. 查询（库中：航司码 15 条 / 机场码 67 条）
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.1 机场码全量列表
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/setting/airports

### 期望 200：{ "total": 67, "items": [ { "id": 1,
###             "chinese_airport_name": "阿布扎比", "english_airport_name": "Abu Dhabi",
###             "airport_iata_code": "AUH", "airport_icao_code": "OMAA" }, … ] }


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.2 模糊搜索 —— q 同时匹配 中文名 / 英文名 / IATA / ICAO，大小写不敏感
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/setting/airports?q=阿布扎比
### 期望 total = 1

###
GET {{host}}/api/setting/airports?q=abu
### 期望 total = 1（英文名不区分大小写命中 Abu Dhabi）

###
GET {{host}}/api/setting/airports?q=OMAA
### 期望 total = 1（ICAO 精确值命中）

### 无匹配
GET {{host}}/api/setting/airports?q=不存在的机场名

### 期望 total = 0


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.3 按 id 取单条（:id 是整数自增主键）
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/setting/airports/1

### 期望 200：{ "id": 1, "chinese_airport_name": "阿布扎比",
###             "english_airport_name": "Abu Dhabi",
###             "airport_iata_code": "AUH", "airport_icao_code": "OMAA" }


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.4 非整数 id → 404（不是 500）
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/setting/airports/abc

### 期望 404：{ "error": "机场码里没有 id=abc 的记录" }


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.5 未知 :kind → 404
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/setting/not-a-kind

### 期望 404：{ "error": "未知的码表「not-a-kind」（可选：airlines / airports）" }


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.6 航司码列表 + 搜索
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/setting/airlines

### 期望 total = 15

###
GET {{host}}/api/setting/airlines?q=顺丰

### 期望 200：{ … "items": [ { "id": 1, "chinese_airplane_company_name": "顺丰航空",
###             "airplane_company_iata_code": "O3", "airplane_company_icao_code": "CSS" } ] }


### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### B. 机场码 CRUD（假数据，末尾自删）
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.7 新增 —— 必填 chinese_airport_name（是 NOT NULL + UNIQUE 列）
### ------------------------------------------------------------
# @name newAirport
POST {{host}}/api/setting/airports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chinese_airport_name": "测试机场ZZ",
  "english_airport_name": "Test Airport ZZ",
  "airport_iata_code": "QZZ",
  "airport_icao_code": "ZQZZ"
}

### 期望 201：{ "id": 68, "chinese_airport_name": "测试机场ZZ",
###             "english_airport_name": "Test Airport ZZ",
###             "airport_iata_code": "QZZ", "airport_icao_code": "ZQZZ" }


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.8 拿新建的 id 查详情
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/setting/airports/{{newAirport.response.body.$.id}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.9 唯一冲突：同名再来一条 → 409
### ------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/api/setting/airports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chinese_airport_name": "测试机场ZZ",
  "english_airport_name": "Dup",
  "airport_iata_code": "QZY",
  "airport_icao_code": "ZQZY"
}

### 期望 409：{ "error": "该记录已存在（唯一约束冲突）" }


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.10 唯一冲突：换个名字但 IATA 撞车 → 也是 409
### ------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/api/setting/airports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chinese_airport_name": "测试机场ZY",
  "airport_iata_code": "QZZ"
}

### 期望 409（airport_iata_code 是 UNIQUE 列）


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.11 校验：缺 chinese_airport_name → 400
### ------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/api/setting/airports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "english_airport_name": "No Name"
}

### 期望 400：{ "error": "chinese_airport_name（中文机场名）不能为空" }


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.12 局部更新 —— 只改英文名，其余列保持原值
### ------------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{host}}/api/setting/airports/{{newAirport.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "english_airport_name": "ZZ Test Airport (renamed)"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.13 校验：显式把 chinese_airport_name 清空 → 400（NOT NULL 列不许清）
### ------------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{host}}/api/setting/airports/{{newAirport.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chinese_airport_name": ""
}

### 期望 400：{ "error": "chinese_airport_name（中文机场名）不能清空" }


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.14 清空可选列 —— 传 null 表示清空该列（允许）
### ------------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{host}}/api/setting/airports/{{newAirport.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "airport_icao_code": null
}

### 期望 200，airport_icao_code 变成 null


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.15 更新不存在的 id → 404
### ------------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{host}}/api/setting/airports/999999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "english_airport_name": "x"
}

### 期望 404：{ "error": "机场码里没有 id=999999 的记录" }


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.16 删除（自建自删，恢复原状）
### ------------------------------------------------------------
DELETE {{host}}/api/setting/airports/{{newAirport.response.body.$.id}}

### 期望 200：{ "ok": true, "id": 68 }


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.17 删除后再查 → 404
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/setting/airports/{{newAirport.response.body.$.id}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.18 收尾：总数回到 67
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/setting/airports


### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
